@dialogue 1
@characters Cast "characters"
[start]
// @id audio.chatter
Cast.Guide: Hello! These little sounds follow the text. Café, é, and 👩‍🚀 stay readable.
@speech character
// @id audio.robot
Cast.Robot: My lower voice uses one cue per word, with a limited source pool.
@speech character
// @id audio.recording
Cast.Guide: This longer synthetic cue stands in for your full voice recording.
@speech character
@voice {"cue":"greeting","sourceLocale":"en","fallback":"source"}
// @id audio.missing
Cast.Guide: Missing audio keeps subtitles and allows chatter to continue.
@speech character
@voice {"cue":"missing","sourceLocale":"en","fallback":"silent"}
// @id audio.quiet
Cast.Guide: This line explicitly requests silence. (end)
@speech off
